  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Projet de Renforcement de la R&#xe9;silience Socio &#xe9;cologique des Communaut&#xe9;s dans les AMP du S&#xe9;n&#xe9;gal (RESICOM) in Senegal,implemented by Enda Energie Senegal aims to strengthen the resilience of communities and mangrove ecosystems in Marine Protected Areas (MPAs) in the Sine Saloum and Casamance regions.  The objectives of the grant are strengthened mangrove ecosystems and improved biodiversity through community led restoration and conservation and the promotion of income-generating activities for women. The key activities include reforesting 20 ha of mangrove in the Ufoyal Kassa Bandial MPA; Setting up an integrated market garden in the Gandoul MPA; Developing market access for local products. This project specifically targets womens groups and womens organisations</narrative>
  </description>
